    {
      "name": "delegate",
      "docs": [
        "Base layer: delegate the vault PDA to an Ephemeral Rollup validator.",
        "",
        "`payer` must be the vault `owner` (read from account data). Matches Magicblock `anchor-counter`",
        "`delegate`: pass **only** base seeds to `delegate_pda` \u2014 the SDK calls",
        "`find_program_address(pda_seeds, program_id)` and appends the bump itself. Do **not** include",
        "the bump as a third seed slice (that double-counts the bump and breaks CPI signer seeds).",
        "",
        "Optional `remaining_accounts[0]`: ER validator pubkey. Use `[]` on hosted devnet ER; for",
        "local `ephemeral-validator` pass the local identity from Magicblock docs."
